  "description": "One cross-platform Datadog API for .NET MAUI: RUM, Logs, Trace and Session Replay on\n      Android, iOS and Mac Catalyst from shared code, over the native dd-sdk-android and\n      dd-sdk-ios bindings. Restores and no-ops on Windows, so a multi-headed app needs no\n      conditionals.",
